WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
MARMALADE BOY

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.442
Dakedo ki ni naru

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.554
Kinou yori mo zutto...

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:21.414
Togireta yume. ..

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.825
Futari no tsuzukiga shiritai!

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.402
Ah, kami—sama...
jikan o... tomete yo

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:43.006
Kyou kasho... seifuku...
mada kami, kawakana... i

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, tasukete...
ribbon ga kimaranai...

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
Aitsu no yume mita sei... yo

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.295
Koge—kake no toast kajitara...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
Naze ka fui ni...
mune ga tokimeita...

00:01:10.709 --> 00:01:15.578
Amakute nigai. .. marmalade

00:01:15.714 --> 00:01:18.148
Dakara ki ni naru...

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Konna kimochi wa naze?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Ima ichiban...

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:28.951
Aitsu no egao wo mitai!

00:01:42.074 --> 00:01:47.011
MIKI

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:46.894
QUALIFICATION OF LOVE —
"YOU DON'T DESERVE YUU!"

00:14:10.154 --> 00:14:12.748
MARMALADE BOY

00:14:18.896 --> 00:14:21.490
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.302 --> 00:22:12.326
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:36.225
MEIKO'S SECRET —
"I WISH YOU HAD TOLD ME."

00:22:54.445 --> 00:23:00.577
Seiza—tachiga kirameite. ..
hizuke o kaeru

00:23:02.186 --> 00:23:08.489
Yosoyuki—gao ga ko cha ni...
sotto tokeru no

00:23:08.826 --> 00:23:16.961
Tada no watashi ni...
modoru shunkan

00:23:17.668 --> 00:23:22.833
Mada mada ima
wa nemuresou ni nai...

00:23:24.275 --> 00:23:27.301
Totsuzen—sugiru. ..

00:23:28.078 --> 00:23:31.980
Atarashii tokimeki ni

00:23:37.154 --> 00:23:39.622
Okashi—na kimochi yo

00:23:39.757 --> 00:23:47.357
Tatta hitori no...
dareka ni kawatteyuku...

00:23:47.965 --> 00:23:54.962
Sonna yokan. ..
dakishimeteitai. ..

00:23:55.539 --> 00:23:59.100
Nemuru made...
